# Compiled and generated artifacts — regenerated by the build/generate scripts,
# never hand-formatted.
node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
coverage/
openapi.json

# Prisma owns its migration SQL.
prisma/migrations/

# Prose. Prettier reflows Markdown list markers and table alignment; the
# documentation-integrity suites parse these files, so they keep their
# hand-tuned whitespace.
*.md

# Workflow and compose config. ci-workflows.test.ts asserts against exact
# indentation, so YAML is left to its authors.
*.yml
*.yaml

# Trusted GitHub Actions scripts (.github/scripts/*.cjs). security-scan.cjs
# runs under pull_request_target and reads the pull request's changed lines as
# data, matching them against the very malware patterns it exists to catch. It
# and its test fixtures legitimately contain those patterns (miner URLs,
# reverse shells, base64 loaders) to prove the scanner works. Reformatting them
# would move those strings into a PR's diff and make the scanner flag its own
# fixtures as hostile changes, so they stay untouched by the formatter (lint
# still covers them).
.github/
